    silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicVoid is the pathological clinic node that absorbs all household nodes under a fixed-node graph hom. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ClinicVoid', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

