    silm:hasExample "In 'TypedArrowsNotGraphEdgesYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the clinic image of Mittens carries an outgoing arrow profile equal to the image of the household outgoing profile under TransportF; also, the functor F sends Mittens to F(Mittens), giving the central object of the transport diagram its clinic-side image." .

